    ax_h_op:"Operator", ax_op_same:"Same operator as now",
    ax_op_nt:"\"Operator\" is told apart by the domain of the mailbox address (e.g. example.com). Mailboxes with the same operator can stop together when that operator stops its hosts, so a mailbox with a different operator is the safer place to move to. One person may also run hosts under different domains.",
