    af_op_same:"Every mailbox it can move to has the same operator as the current one ({o}). If that whole operator stops, they can't be reached either, so no move is possible. Renting a mailbox from a different operator is safer.",
    af_op_use:"{m} of the {n} mailboxes your devices use have the same operator ({o}). If this operator stops its hosts, those {m} stop together.",
