    ntc_afmove:"Your mailbox was moved automatically ({f} → {t})", ntd_afmove:"Your usual mailbox could not be reached for an hour, so Handpost moved to a mailbox you already rent. Devices that used the same mailbox are told through your other mailboxes. If a device does not follow, use [Give the new location to other devices by QR] in the Moving section of the Mailbox tab. To stop automatic moves, clear the checkbox in the same section.",
    ntc_afmove2:"Your mailbox was moved automatically ({f} → {t}; also used by {d})", ntd_afmove2:"Your usual mailbox could not be reached for an hour and no unused mailbox could be used, so Handpost moved to a mailbox your other devices also use. When the admin device moves next time, devices using the same mailbox move with it. Devices that used the same mailbox are told through your other mailboxes. If a device does not follow, use [Give the new location to other devices by QR] in the Moving section of the Mailbox tab. To stop automatic moves, clear the checkbox in the same section.",
