    nt_xm_own:"People in your address book may be able to see this account's balance and transactions. If that bothers you, you can create a separate account for rent in Xaman and pay from it.",
    xm_opening:"Opening Xaman. Please approve in Xaman (if no window opens, allow pop-ups for this page)",
    xb_back_title:"Approved in Xaman", xb_back_text:"This page is where Xaman returned after a sign-in requested from the Handpost on your Home Screen. Safari and the Home Screen Handpost run separately, so the sign-in is finished in the Home Screen Handpost.\n1. Tap [Copy text] below\n2. Go back to the Home Screen Handpost\n3. Paste into the box that appears and tap [Finish sign-in]", xb_back_note:"This text works only once, and only in the Handpost that asked for it. You can close this page after pasting.", btn_xb_copy:"Copy text", xb_copied:"Copied. Go back to the Home Screen Handpost and paste it.", xb_copy_no:"Could not copy. Press and hold the text above, select all, and copy it.", xb_paste_title:"Paste the text from Safari", xb_paste_text:"After you approve in Xaman, Safari opens a page saying \"Approved in Xaman\". Tap [Copy text] there, then come back here, paste it into the box below, and tap [Finish sign-in].", xb_paste_ph:"Paste here", btn_xb_paste:"Paste", btn_xb_go:"Finish sign-in", btn_xb_open:"Paste the text from Safari", btn_xb_close:"Close", xb_e_empty:"Paste the text you copied with [Copy text] on the Safari page.", xb_e_bad:"This text is incomplete. Tap [Copy text] on the Safari page and paste it again.", xb_e_state:"This text is not from a sign-in requested by this Handpost. Use the sign-in button to approve in Xaman again.", xb_going:"Finishing sign-in (reloading)…",   xs_title:"Sign in to Xaman in Safari", xs_text:"The Home Screen Handpost cannot sign in to Xaman (after you approve, Xaman opens Safari). Sign in in Safari and paste the text it shows here.\n1. Tap [Copy link]\n2. Open Safari, paste it into the address bar and open it\n3. On that page, tap [Sign in with Xaman] and approve in Xaman\n4. Tap [Copy text], come back here and paste it below\n5. Tap [Finish sign-in]", btn_xs_link:"Copy link", xs_link_ok:"Copied. Paste it into the Safari address bar and open it.", xs_link_no:"Could not copy. Press and hold the link above to copy it, or type it into the Safari address bar.", xs_e_bad:"This text cannot be read. Tap [Copy text] on the Safari page and paste it again.", xs_e_old:"This text is too old (more than 10 minutes since it was made). Tap [Sign in with Xaman] again on the Safari page and paste the new text.", xs_e_save:"Could not store it in this Handpost. Reopen the Home Screen Handpost and paste again.", xs_st:"Sign in in Safari (follow the steps in the window)",
