    rn_n_key:"Xaman shows \"Account Set\". It only writes a key to your account so the mailbox address can be sent to you encrypted (fee under 0.001 XAH).\nXaman may ask questions such as \"Is someone promising you free rewards, airdrops, or cryptocurrency?\". That is Xaman's scam check. This payment is you paying your own mailbox rent to the host: nobody promised you rewards and nobody asked you to pay. None of it applies, so answer \"No\" and continue.",
    rn_x_acq:"Handpost {i}/{n}: rent a mailbox (host {h}…, first hour {p} EVR)",
    rn_n_acq:"Xaman shows \"Buy URI Token\", \"Untitled / NOT FOUND\" and \"The issuer can burn this token.\" This buys the mailbox's lease token and is normal (the host burns the token when the lease ends).\nXaman may ask questions such as \"Is someone promising you free rewards, airdrops, or cryptocurrency?\". That is Xaman's scam check. This payment is you paying your own mailbox rent to the host: nobody promised you rewards and nobody asked you to pay. None of it applies, so answer \"No\" and continue.",
