    nt_lease:"When your rented mailbox expires. Read from the Xahau ledger for your rental account. From 14 days before, the ⏳ in the header turns yellow; from 7 days before you're reminded each time you open the app (and once in Security notices); on the last day it turns red. Extend from the Renew section below; the button here re-reads the date from the ledger.",
    ntc_lease:"Your mailbox lease is ending or has ended (until {t})",
    ntd_lease:"Renew the lease. Once it expires, new mail can't arrive. If you can't renew, rent a new mailbox and move.",
    nd_post_try:" (try {n})",
