      rel_title:"Handpost version", rel_ok:"This is the latest official Handpost (version {n}). The developer's seal was verified ({t}).", rel_ok0:"This is the official Handpost. The developer's seal was verified ({t}).", rel_old:"This is an older version of the official Handpost (open: version {o}). A new version (version {n}) is available. Reopen Handpost or press [Reload] to update. You can keep sending letters.", rel_unknown:"The Handpost you have open does not match any official version (file that differed: {f}). Exchanges with mailboxes are stopped (letters are kept and waiting). Press [Reload]. If that does not help, turn off browser extensions and reopen, or tell the developer.", rel_served:"A file sent by the distribution site does not match the developer's seal ({f}). Exchanges with mailboxes are stopped (letters are kept and waiting). A new version may be in the middle of being published, so do not reload; wait a few minutes. Handpost checks again automatically and resumes when it matches. If this goes on, tell the developer.", rel_bad:"The list of files being distributed does not match the developer's seal. Exchanges with mailboxes are stopped (letters are kept and waiting). Do not reload; please tell the developer. It resumes automatically once the seal matches.", rel_bad_short:"Stopped: the developer's seal does not match", rel_nosig:"The distributed version has no developer's seal. Handpost will check again automatically. If this goes on, tell the developer.", rel_skip:"Not checked here (checked when opened at handpost.page).", rel_err:"Could not check ({e}). Check your connection. Handpost will check again automatically.", rel_wait:"Checking…", rel_note:"Handpost versions are protected by a seal (signature) made with the developer's key. Each time Handpost opens, and every 30 minutes while it is open, it checks that the files it loaded match an official version. Check number {fp} (for comparing with the developer).", btn_rel_again:"Check again",
