    re1_body:"Enter the 14 words from your paper backup. Your account (the same address as before) comes back on this device.\nWith the 14 words alone, your contacts, their cards, your display name and settings do not come back. Afterwards you rent a mailbox and ask your friends to scan your invitation again.\nMessage history and photos do not come back either way (they are never stored anywhere).",   re_more_sum:"Enter it to restore your contacts too (if your old mailbox is still running)", re_more_nt:"If your old mailbox is still running, enter its address here and your contacts, their cards, your display name, blocks and settings come back as well. The address is the text starting with wss:// that you copied on line 15 of the paper.\nIf the lease ran out and the mailbox is gone, or you do not know its address, leave this empty. The 14 words above are enough to restore your account.\nIf you enter an address and it cannot be reached, you can then choose to restore with the 14 words alone.",     re_id_title:"Restore account only", re_id_q:"This restores your account from the 14 words alone, without connecting to a mailbox.\nOnly your address (the same as before) comes back. Contacts, their cards, your display name and settings do not.\nAfterwards, rent a new mailbox and exchange invitations with your friends. Show your invitation QR with [Invite] next to your name and have your friend scan it with the 📷 in Handpost. Then have your friend show theirs with [Invite] and scan it with your 📷 (for friends you cannot meet, send each other links with [Copy invitation link]).\nIf your old mailbox is still running, cancel and enter line 15 of the paper (wss://…) in \"Mailbox address\" below the 14 words first: then your contacts come back too.", btn_re_idonly:"Restore account only", re_id_offer:"If the lease ran out and the mailbox is gone, use [Restore account only] to come back with just the 14 words.", re3_idonly:"Your account is back (same address as before).\nYou have no mailbox yet. Rent one in the Mailbox tab.\nContacts were not restored. After renting a mailbox, exchange invitations with your friends. Show your invitation QR with [Invite] next to your name and have your friend scan it with the 📷 in Handpost. Then have your friend show theirs with [Invite] and scan it with your 📷 (for friends you cannot meet, send each other links with [Copy invitation link]).", btn_re_tobox:"Go rent a mailbox", re_s_id:"Restoring your account…",
