    pp1_body:"Nobody holds your Handpost account for you (not the people who make Handpost, and not the host of your mailbox).\n\nThe 14 words shown next are the only way to get your account back if you lose all of your devices.\n- Copy them onto paper by hand (no photos, no screenshots, no notes apps)\n- It is safer to write 2 or more copies and keep each one in a different place\n- Keep every copy where nobody else can see it. If even one copy reaches someone else, they can take your account\n- Don't forget where you put them\n\nIf you forget your passphrase or your passkey stops working, you can also open this device with the paper.",
